<title>USA: U.S. bulk millfeeds - Prices stay steady to down.</title>
<headline>U.S. bulk millfeeds - Prices stay steady to down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millfeed prices remained steady to lower Thursday as several dealers noted a lack of buyers in the market due to lower-priced substitutes.</p>
<p>&quot;People were not too anxious on the buyside,&quot; a Buffalo dealer said. &quot;They seem to be hard to find.&quot;</p>
<p>He noted that when the market begins to break, buyers make themselves scarce. &quot;If they wait a little longer, (prices) will be easier,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
